MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 ArrayTest_TestLength
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

ArrayTest_TestLength [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE  TIMES  PLUS 10 1  4
MOVE TEMP 4 4
L2 CJUMP  LE TEMP 4 MINUS  TIMES  PLUS 10 1  4  1 L3
HSTORE  PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 4 0  0
MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 4 4
JUMP L2
L3 HSTORE TEMP 3 0 10
RETURN TEMP 3
END


MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 1 0
RETURN TEMP 5
END

PRINT TEMP 2

RETURN 0
END

